This looks like tuna salad: tuna mixed with mayo, celery, red onion, and a little carrot. It sits on a square plate roughly 25 cm across, and the pile is about 11 cm wide. I estimate the portion at roughly 130 g. Tuna salad with mayo runs about 180 kcal per 100 g, so 130 g comes to about 235 kcal.

The grated carrot on the left plate is a separate plate, so I left it out.

